    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, 포켓몬 승부에서\n트랩 기술은 활용하고 있니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C5D0C11C000AD2B8B7A90020AE30C220C7400020D65CC6A9D558ACE00020C788B2C8003F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트랩 기술은 사용했을 때 필드에 효과가 남는\n일부 기술을 말하는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B7A90020AE30C220C7400020C0ACC6A9D588C7440020B54C0020D544B4DCC5D00020D6A8ACFCAC000020B0A8B294000AC77CBD800020AE30C220C7440020B9D0D558B2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "필드에 남은 불꽃이나 바위는\n이동을 방해하거나<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n닿았을 때 데미지를 줄 수 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D544B4DCC5D00020B0A8C7400020BD88AF43C774B0980020BC14C704B294000AC774B3D9C7440020BC29D574D558AC70B09800100001BE00000AB2FFC558C7440020B54C0020B370BBF8C9C0B97C0020C9040020C2180020C788C5B4002E00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트랩 기술이 얼마나 무시무시한지\n내가 특별히 가르쳐 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B7A90020AE30C220C7740020C5BCB9C8B0980020BB34C2DCBB34C2DCD55CC9C0000AB0B4AC000020D2B9BCC4D7880020AC00B974CCD00020C904AC8C002E00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부를 통해 배울 각오가 됐다면\n내게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80B97C0020D1B5D5740020BC30C6B80020AC01C624AC000020B410B2E4BA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트랩 기술의 전문가인\n나와 승부해 보겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B7A90020AE30C220C7580020C804BB38AC00C778000AB098C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020BCF4ACA0C5B4003F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비라...\n준비를 한다고 내 트랩을 피할 수 있을까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44B77C002E002E002E000AC900BE44B97C0020D55CB2E4ACE00020B0B40020D2B8B7A9C7440020D53CD5600020C2180020C788C744AE4C003F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬의 기술은 전부\n트랩을 설치하는 기술이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220C7400020C804BD80000AD2B8B7A9C7440020C124CE58D558B2940020AE30C220C774C57C002100100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "과연 네가 트랩을 피할 수 있을까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACFCC5F00020B124AC000020D2B8B7A9C7440020D53CD5600020C2180020C788C744AE4C003F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호오... 그렇게나 트랩을 설치했는데도\n나를 이기다니.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638C624002E002E002E0020ADF8B807AC8CB0980020D2B8B7A9C7440020C124CE58D588B294B370B3C4000AB098B97C0020C774AE30B2E4B2C8002E00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 필드에 트랩이 있으니\n많이 성가셨지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020D544B4DCC5D00020D2B8B7A9C7740020C788C73CB2C8000AB9CEC7740020C131AC00C168C9C0003F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 트랩 기술을 능숙하게 활용하면서\n테크니컬하게 싸워 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
